@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms and Conditions";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "Read the terms for using the Ubhaya Fashions online store and placing orders.";
}

<main class="store-policy"><header class="store-policy-hero"><span>UBHAYA FASHIONS · SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE</span><h1>Terms &amp; <em>Conditions</em></h1><p>Please read these terms before placing an order or using our online store.</p></header><nav class="store-policy-nav"><a asp-action="Privacy">Privacy</a><a class="active" asp-action="Terms">Terms</a><a asp-action="Returns">Returns &amp; Refunds</a><a asp-action="Cancellation">Cancellation</a><a asp-controller="Shipping" asp-action="Index">Shipping</a></nav><div class="store-policy-content">
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏷️</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>Who we are</h2><p>UBHAYA FASHIONS operates this online store for women's clothing and fashion products. Contact us through our <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index">Contact Us</a> page for assistance.</p></div></section>
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛍️</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>Orders and pricing</h2><p>By placing an order, you confirm that your contact and delivery details are accurate and that you are authorised to use the selected payment method. Prices are displayed in Indian Rupees. Applicable taxes and delivery charges are shown at checkout. Orders are subject to product availability and successful payment. If we cancel an order due to unavailability, a genuine listing error or inability to fulfil it, amounts received for that order will be refunded.</p></div></section>
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">👗</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>Products and colour</h2><p>We make reasonable efforts to display product descriptions, images, colours and sizes accurately. Slight colour variations may occur due to lighting, photography and screen settings. Review product details and size information before ordering.</p></div></section>
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">🚫</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>No returns or exchanges</h2><p>All purchases are final. We do not accept returns or exchanges for change of mind, size selection or personal preference, subject to rights and remedies that cannot legally be excluded. See our <a asp-action="Returns">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a>.</p></div></section>
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">💳</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>Payment and delivery</h2><p>Payment options are shown at checkout. An order is confirmed after successful payment and order confirmation. Delivery timelines are estimates and may vary by location and courier operations. See our <a asp-controller="Shipping" asp-action="Index">Shipping Policy</a>.</p></div></section>
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">©️</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>Website content</h2><p>Product photographs, text, logos, graphics and website design belong to UBHAYA FASHIONS or their respective owners. Do not copy, reproduce or reuse them without permission or misuse the website.</p></div></section>
<section class="store-policy-card"><div class="store-policy-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚖️</div><div class="store-policy-copy"><h2>Changes and legal rights</h2><p>We may update these terms from time to time. Nothing here is intended to exclude rights or remedies that cannot lawfully be excluded under applicable law.</p></div></section></div><p class="store-policy-date">Last updated: 31 October 2026</p></main>
